Error %d writing record: no lock is held on it.\n\nA WRITE must already hold an update lock on the record, or a lock on the file,\nwhen it runs inside a transaction or when this system sets MUSTLOCK=1. Nothing\nwas written and the stored record is unchanged.\n\nTake the lock first - READU reads and locks a record, READVU a single field -\nthen WRITE. The WRITE releases it again, and so do RELEASE and the end of the\ntransaction.
